omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UwOrdvQtcPgQ7kNvwFhG0NR&_nc_oc=Adq3um27fLWiH3SsqT9-b751GzKVbTmOsMWlXJ2nKuc9uo3xc4kgufxs5X-_9ALw1k8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2E_z5yIg9G5a-JZak56DO5re1FbtSPICh2_2au1sscBw&oe=69EF7F34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JBN18QUd_VoQ7kNvwGIrboQ&_nc_oc=AdotJbZS_gY48CeyvQ2Dzdy6EV_ezl-IObiyaqy2pQPXDZdxe-Dr4NOkdrr-avb34UA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1YEEs4fHwNrw2JnCVvSWtjFq6pAMpN2eklr78k0S0oOA&oe=69EF8096"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2HeznhUIK7IQ7kNvwEKYxNX&_nc_oc=Adq6D80cRXrPOKQVp3GPcpcZEadaG2voW0GYlIe34HsdCewhB8FbunsCiHEXfFAxtbY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1b9l0_7W7WjhTEO6vQyAWDob_cUEMRwx4GoHk1swIpSg&oe=69EF5D77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://